<title>PORTUGAL: Portucel issuing 15 bln esc domestic paper.</title>
<headline>Portucel issuing 15 bln esc domestic paper.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portucel-SGPS is launching an eight-year bond for 15 billion escudos, indexed for the first five years to the six-month Lisbor rate plus 2.5 basis points and paying a fixed-rate of 8.2 percent for the final three years, lead manager Banco Santander de Negocios (Portugal) said.  </p>
<p>BORROWER  Portucel  AMT 15 bln esc</p>
<p>COUPON Lisbor+2.5 bps 1-5 yrs, fixed 8.2 pct 6-8 yrs</p>
<p>    MATURITY 5/11/2004		ISS PRICE 100</p>
<p>    PAY DATE 5/10/96		  PAY FREQ Six-monthly</p>
<p>    GOV LAW Portuguese		LISTING Lisbon</p>
<p>PUT OPTION Exercisable from 4th coupon</p>
<p>CALL OPTION Exercisable from 10th coupon</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
